  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Roughly shred Bambino wombok.\n• Thinly slice red radish into rounds.\n• Slice lemon into wedges.\n• Thinly slice spring onion.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d6745a587f17f4588e8d/step-c088b200.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, whisk together basic sponge mix (see ingredients), the water (for the batter), egg, vegetable stock pot and a pinch of salt and pepper, until smooth.\n• Add half the shredded wombok, stirring until well combined.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d6745a587f17f4588e8d/step-0c781710.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat the base over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, add heaped tablespoons of the mixture, in batches, flattening with a spatula. Cook until golden, 3-4 minutes each side (don't flip too early!).\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. You should get 2-3 okonomiyakis per person.\n• TIP: Add extra oil between batches as needed.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d6745a587f17f4588e8d/step-a2c2b520.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Wash out frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• When the oil is hot, add vegetable gyoza, flat-side down, in a single layer.\n• Cook until starting to brown, 1-2 minutes. Cook in batches if your pan is getting crowded. Add the water (for the gyozas) (watch out, it may spatter!) and cover with foil or a lid.\n• Cook until the water has evaporated and gyoza are tender and softened, 4-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d6745a587f17f4588e8d/step-c503fc30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the gyozas are cooking, to a medium bowl, add remaining wombok, radish and tear in coriander.\n• Add a good squeeze of lemon juice and a drizzle of olive oil. Toss to combine and season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d6745a587f17f4588e8d/step-34801a40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide mini Bambino wombok okonomiyaki, radish salad and veggie gyozas between plates.\n• Drizzle BBQ sauce and mayonnaise over the okonomiyaki. Garnish with spring onion and pickled ginger.\n• Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d6745a587f17f4588e8d/step-11e04150.jpg"
    }
  ]
